  "tandemSoGehts": [
    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B the right.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and asks it: “¿Dónde trabajas?”",
    "B hears the question and builds the answer. Take off the ending of the blue verb (-ar, -er, -ir) and add the one for the person: hablo, hablas, habla, hablamos, habláis, hablan. A tile in brackets, like (yo), says who; do not write it.",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Finally: swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
